 ## Background
-This method was introduced in the context of the Point-Splatting-Multi-View-2D-Rendering-Pipeline project to generate multi-view camera poses for large-scale outdoor point clouds, specifically ancient city walls [S1, unofficial]. It replaces the hardcoded, room-centric poses used in previous indoor-focused methods like Virtual-Multi-View-Fusion [S1, unofficial].
